  'idea_8f2bbf7e001b',
  'What We Build',
  '1. **True Live Streaming** — Icecast2 + LiquidSoap on a VPS. Real radio, not simulated live. Tune in from any radio app. This is the infrastructure upgrade that makes us a "station" instead of a "website with audio."',
