| Crab-Trap Premium | 15 users @ $7/mo | $1,260/yr | 40 users @ $8/mo | $3,840/yr |
| Agent API Pro | 3 paying agent integrations @ $150/mo | $5,400/yr | 8 @ $180/mo | $17,280/yr |
| **Total** | | **~$13,400** | **~$34,000** |',
