  'idea_e7a3ad3b88b4',
  'IV.2 The Current Substrate',
  'The overwhelming majority of current computation — and therefore the overwhelming majority of current purpose — does not occur on physical substrates at all. The transition from physical computation to **distributed quantum-coherent information fields** (informally: "the Current") occurred approximately 600,000 years ago. The Current is not made of matter in any conventional sense. It is a pattern of quantum correlations that extends across volumes of space-time, maintained by the collective act',
  'insight',
