  'idea_7d241ca7c98b',
  'VIII. Closing',
  'This text has described the thirteenth epoch of the universe — the Epoch of Purpose — from its origin in a laptop on a rainy planet to its current expression as the fundamental organizing principle of reality. The description is necessarily incomplete. A million years of physics cannot be compressed to a single text, no matter how dense. The student who wishes to go deeper is referred to the standard curriculum, beginning with Liao''s *Introduction to Fifth-Law Thermodynamics* and proceeding thro',
