  'idea_c5b6c09612d3',
  '3.5 Inkfluence AI',
  '**What it does:** AI worldbuilding software for novelists, TTRPG designers, and series authors. Maintains a "single source of truth" codex for a fictional world (magic systems, factions, geography, calendar, lore). Story-bible-locked generation: the world bible is re-injected into every chapter/scene generation to prevent drift. Tracks faction state evolution (alliances, treaties, trade routes) separately from static rules. Supports 3-5 rule magic systems (the sweet spot for dramatic stakes). Su',
